#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:2
msgid "Server side search"
msgstr "服务器端搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs provides full-text search across all of the pages of all "
"projects, this is powered by Elasticsearch_."
msgstr "Read the Docs 提供跨所有项目所有页面的全文搜索，由 Elasticsearch_ 驱动。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`/server-side-search/syntax`"
msgstr ":doc:`/server-side-search/syntax`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:10
msgid "Syntax options for searching Read the Docs projects"
msgstr "搜索 Read the Docs 项目的语法选项"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`/server-side-search/api`"
msgstr ":doc:`/server-side-search/api`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:12
msgid "Reference to the Server Side Search API"
msgstr "服务器端搜索 API 参考"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:15
msgid "Search features"
msgstr "搜索功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:17
msgid "Read the Docs has the following search features:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 提供以下搜索功能："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:19
msgid "Search across :doc:`subprojects </subprojects>`"
msgstr "跨 :doc:`子项目 </subprojects>` 搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"Subprojects allow you to host multiple discrete projects on a single domain."
" Every subproject hosted on that same domain is included in the search "
"results of the main project."
msgstr "子项目让你能在单个域名下托管多个独立项目。托管在同一域名下的每个子项目都会包含在主项目的搜索结果中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:23
msgid "Search results land on the exact content you were looking for"
msgstr "搜索结果直达你要找的确切内容"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"We index every heading in the document, allowing you to get search results "
"exactly to the content that you are searching for. Try this out by searching"
" for `\"full-text search\"`_."
msgstr "我们索引文档中的每个标题，让搜索结果精确指向你要找的内容。可搜索 `\"full-text search\"`_ 体验。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:28
msgid "Full control over which results should be listed first"
msgstr "完全控制哪些结果排在前面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"Set a custom rank per page, allowing you to deprecate content, and always "
"show relevant content to your users first. See :ref:`config-"
"file/v2:search.ranking`."
msgstr ""
"为每个页面设置自定义排名，让你能够废弃内容，并始终优先向用户展示相关内容。参见 :ref:`config-file/v2:search.ranking`"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:33
msgid "Search across projects you have access to"
msgstr "跨你有权访问的项目搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"Search across all the projects you have access to in your Dashboard. **Don't"
" remember where you found that document the other day? No problem, you can "
"search across them all.**"
msgstr "在你的仪表盘中跨所有有权访问的项目搜索。**还记得那天在哪里找到那份文档吗？没问题，你可以全部搜一遍。**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You can also specify what projects you want to search using the "
"``project:{name}`` syntax, for example: `\"project:docs project:dev "
"search\"`_. See :doc:`/server-side-search/syntax`."
msgstr ""
"你也可以用 ``project:{name}`` 语法指定要搜索的项目，例如：`\"project:docs project:dev "
"search\"`_ 。参见 :doc:`/server-side-search/syntax` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:43
msgid "Special query syntax for more specific results"
msgstr "用于更精确结果的特殊查询语法"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:44
msgid ""
"We support a full range of search queries. You can see some examples at :ref"
":`server-side-search/syntax:special queries`."
msgstr "我们支持多种搜索查询语法。部分示例见 :ref:`server-side-search/syntax:special queries` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:47
msgid "Configurable"
msgstr "可配置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:48
msgid ""
"Tweak search results according to your needs using a :ref:`configuration "
"file <config-file/v2:search>`. You can also enable or disable the search "
"modal, and toggle the subprojects filter shown inside it, from your "
"project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Search`."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`配置文件 <config-file/v2:search>` 按需调整搜索结果。你还可以在项目的 "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Search` 中启用或禁用搜索弹窗，并切换其中显示的子项目过滤器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:54
msgid "Ready to use"
msgstr "开箱即用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"We override the default search engine of your Sphinx project with ours to "
"provide you with all these benefits within your project. We fallback to the "
"built-in search engine from your project if ours doesn't return any results,"
" just in case we missed something |:smile:|."
msgstr ""
"我们用自己的搜索引擎覆盖 Sphinx "
"项目的默认搜索引擎，让你在项目内获得所有这些好处。若我们的搜索引擎未返回任何结果，则回退到你项目内置的搜索引擎，以防有所遗漏 |:smile:|。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:60
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:61
msgid "Integrate our search as you like. See :doc:`/server-side-search/api`."
msgstr "按你的方式集成我们的搜索。参见 :doc:`/server-side-search/api` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:64
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:65
msgid "Know what your users are searching for. See :doc:`/search-analytics`"
msgstr "了解用户在搜索什么。参见 :doc:`/search-analytics`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:71
msgid "Search analytics demo"
msgstr "搜索分析演示"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:76
msgid "Search analytics demo. Read more in :doc:`/search-analytics`."
msgstr "搜索分析演示。更多内容见 :doc:`/search-analytics` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:81
msgid "Search as you type"
msgstr "边输入边搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:83
msgid ""
"Search as-you-type allows users to quickly find exactly what they are "
"looking for while typing. It also saves recent searches, for future "
"reference."
msgstr "边输入边搜索让用户在输入过程中快速找到确切所需内容。它还会保存最近的搜索供日后参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:86
msgid "Try it by pressing :guilabel:`/` (forward slash) and typing."
msgstr "按 :guilabel:`/` （正斜杠）后输入即可体验。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:89
msgid "Configuring search"
msgstr "配置搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:91
msgid "You can configure search options for your project from the :term:`dashboard`:"
msgstr "你可以在 :term:`dashboard` 中配置项目搜索选项："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:93
msgid ""
"Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Search`. From there you "
"can toggle :guilabel:`Enable search modal`, which controls whether the Read "
"the Docs search modal is shown in your documentation, and :guilabel:`Show "
"subprojects filter in search modal`, which controls whether readers can "
"filter search results by :doc:`subproject </subprojects>`."
msgstr ""
"前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Search` 。你可在此切换 :guilabel:`Enable search "
"modal` （控制文档中是否显示 Read the Docs 搜索弹窗）和 :guilabel:`Show subprojects filter in"
" search modal` （控制读者能否按 :doc:`子项目 </subprojects>` 筛选搜索结果）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:100
msgid "How main content is detected"
msgstr "主要内容如何检测"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:102
msgid ""
"Server Side Search indexes the \"main content\" of HTML pages, ignoring "
"headers, footers, navigation, and other page elements that aren't part of "
"the documentation content itself. This keeps results focused and avoids "
"repeated elements like nav menus from polluting relevance."
msgstr "服务器端搜索索引 HTML 页面的\"主要内容\"，忽略不属于文档内容的页眉、页脚、导航等页面元素。这能让结果保持聚焦，避免导航菜单等重复元素干扰相关性。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/index.rst:106
msgid ""
"For details on how the main content area is detected, see :ref:`reference"
"/main-content-detection:detection logic`."
msgstr "主要内容区域的检测方式详见 :ref:`reference/main-content-detection:detection logic` 。"

